{
 "_about": "Vocal chains for fl_vocal_chain (fl-headless). Stock FL plugins first; the numbers are starting points that fl_vocal_chain adjusts from measuring the take (sibilance band, mud, proximity low end, dynamic range, tempo). Extend or override: put a chains.json with the same shape in <fl-headless state folder>/vocal/ (it is merged over this one). When applying, settings go through flh_mixeng's plugin maps (ns plugin_set_named: units, enums, read-back) when it is loaded; 'param_hints' are only the fallback (words matched against the plugin's live parameter names; enums such as band types are then left to the user) - PC-VERIFY them per FL version. Timing: reverb decay_beats and delay beats are in quarter-note beats at the song tempo; predelay_note is a fraction of a whole note (1/64 = 0.015625), clamped to 10-80 ms.",
 "plugins": {
  "eq": "Fruity Parametric EQ 2",
  "compressor": "Fruity Compressor",
